    "turn_idx": 41,
    "turn_text": "That's a fundamental misreading of the situation. Now, do I support defunding the police? No. Did the defund allegation hurt me? Sure. Did I have to spend it? And it hurt me in the sense that I had to spend a lot of money countering this. Showing people I don't support defunding and there's an opportunity cost there. But in the end, probably the vast majority of the district didn't believe that I supported defunding the police. There's actually something deeper going on here. And that was my participation in this March.",
