    "turn_idx": 120,
    "turn_text": "So we adopted a child, a newborn baby boy, his name is Miles. We actually, he was born on March 15th, 14th. Wow. And right at the height of the shutdown and then on April 1st, I got activated in the National Guard and he left for six weeks to go help stand up a COVID only hospital complex on Staten Island. Well, I think it's been, you know, my wife bless her. This was a tough year for everybody, but the fact that we welcomed Miles into our life, and now he's starting to crawl and smiling when I walk in the room. I mean, that's just such a silver lining of all this. It's just, you know, I never understood the love that you can have for your kid.",
