    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72856.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 121,
    "turn_text": "It also, I think, really does, I mean, is all this is a cliche about parenting. But like, you know, for me, when I was going through that period in 2013 and to 14, that was brutal, it was like, you know, the kids were just at that point, we had won, and then our second was born in 2014, like, It's a sense of yourself and what's important in value that's totally independent of all that stuff about who's saying what about you and whatever happened on Twitter and it could be pretty important in moments where the outside world feels tough.",
