        "text": "Institutions like Congress are shaped by interpersonal dynamics and individual motivations.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Understanding institutional functioning depends on recognizing human fallibility and emotionality.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Criticism from others should not undermine self-worth or integrity.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Personal relationships and emotional connections influence political outcomes in Congress.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Emotional regulation requires intentional effort and practice.",
        "confidence": 0.91
